<title>USA: Gore to host talks with Chernomyrdin in February.</title>
<headline>Gore to host talks with Chernomyrdin in February.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vice President Al Gore will host talks with Russian Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin on Feb. 6-8 in Washington, the White House said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Gore-Chernomyrdin Commission meets every six months to deal with a broad range of issues of interest to the two countries, including improving trade relations and expanding cooperation in space.</p>
<p>The two leaders are expected to discuss the agenda for a meeting between President Bill Clinton and Russian President Boris Yeltsin, tentatively scheduled for March.</p>
</text>
